Package: PortalPalette
Type: Package
Title: Color Palettes Inspired by the Portal Video Game
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Neuromancer32",
           email = "neuromancer32@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Orange-and-blue color palettes inspired by the Portal video game:
    a lightness-balanced diverging palette, the original 'classic' palette,
    and sequential orange and blue palettes. Includes discrete and continuous
    color and fill scales for 'ggplot2' (with an optional midpoint for
    diverging data) and a matching minimal theme.
License: CC BY 4.0
URL: https://github.com/neuromancer32/PortalPalette
BugReports: https://github.com/neuromancer32/PortalPalette/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
